.TH AERO-DISK-CLEANER 1 "November 2026" "Aero Linux v1.4.0" "Aero Linux Manual"
.SH NAME
aero-disk-cleaner \- Safe system storage hygiene and cache maintenance utility
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aero-disk-cleaner
[B\-\-dry-runR] [B\-\-deepR] [B\-\-helpR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B aero-disk-cleaner
identifies and safely reclaims unneeded package caches, thumbnail directories, and orphaned Docker layers.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-dry-run
Report reclaimable space without deleting files.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
